# --- "hard" slice (M5): keyword-exact + near-sibling-page questions. These stress
# what hybrid/rerank are for — exact API tokens BM25 nails, and adjacent pages a
# dense embedding blurs together (web-fetch vs web-search, handle-tool-calls vs
# how-tool-use-works, migration vs overview). tag=hard so `--tag hard` A/Bs them.
